    {
      "area": "Identity and authenticated IPC",
      "result": "PASS_SOURCE_PLUS_PREVIOUS_NATIVE_BOUNDARY_REVIEW",
      "basis": "RunCanaryService requires real SCM context and exact NT SERVICE virtual-account token before fixed installed path. Client opens SCM query-only, validates account/binary command, binds named pipe PID to running SCM PID before and after exchange and compares summary binary hash to installed immutable bytes. Configuration uses the same PID authentication."
    },
    {
      "area": "Configuration and DPAPI",
      "result": "PASS_PUBLIC_NATIVE_AND_SOURCE",
      "basis": "Config pipe allows only service SID, BA, SY, rejects remote and duplicate instance; ordinary developer native client is denied. Elevated fixed installed helper reads bounded stdin, exact credential bytes flow only through authenticated pipe; private CREATE_NEW user-scoped DPAPI does not start the run. Actual service-account decryption remains post-install evidence."
    },
    {
      "area": "One run and retention",
      "result": "PASS_ACTUAL_PROCESS_CRASH_AND_SOURCE",
      "basis": "CREATE_NEW fsync run marker precedes generation. Each numbered intent fsync precedes IO. Actual child killed after second HTTP arrival; recovery reports one durable response plus one unknown and opens no call factory. Installer erase request holds engine mutex, refuses any marker/unknown file before cancellation, and deletes only known unused canaries/credential and fixed empty directories; existing installation refusal prevents replacement."
    },
    {
      "area": "Exact fixed summary",
      "result": "PASS_NATIVE_PUBLIC_PIPE_AND_TAMPER_TESTS",
      "basis": "RUNNING/status/aggregate/repeated start byte-identical with zero counts/no dataset; unknown command rejected. Terminal finite fixed schema excludes bodies/reasons/IDs, includes static dataset fingerprint. Input canary drift blocks cached terminal output. Strict parser rejects duplicate/unknown fields, threshold/rubric/model/development/scope/authority/total tampering."
    },
    {
      "area": "Metrics and qualification",
      "result": "PASS_INDEPENDENT_ARITHMETIC",
      "basis": "Both language keys exercised separately with 7 positives/8 negatives and manually planned 10 correct/1 false accept/1 false reject/3 abstentions/1 error; .8 admitted and .799999 abstained. Action coverage6 accept/6 reject/3 abstain and ALWAYS_REJECT baseline8 correct/7 false reject exact. Trusted development aggregate exact hash,30/key,rawREJECT30/key,ACCEPTcoverage0. Qualification remains FAILED,ADVISORY,NONE; partial consumed-slot denominators not falsely full30."
    },
    {
      "area": "Installer",
      "result": "PASS_PREDEPLOY_SCOPE",
      "basis": "Default Plan read-only. Real bad hash/SID/unelevated Install/Uninstall negatives rejected and fixed install directory stayed absent. Source verifies project identity and reviewed binary, creates admin-owned protected binary/manifest at directory creation, service-only private owner, fixed SCM account/manual startup/query-only reader access. Source credential read is confined to explicit elevated Install after service creation; it never sends start-frozen-run."
    }
